{"id":"n16136-1-5","stage":1,"title":"모레 · 后天","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16136-1-5-1","ko":"모레 우리 마을에 단수가 된대.","zh":"听说后天我们村里要停水了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"모레","meaning":"后天","explanation":"모레：后天","readings":[{"term":"모레","audio":"/audio/c91f5f33a1ff69245245.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16136","senseId":"1","lemma":"모레","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"마을에","meaning":"村子，村庄","explanation":"마을：村子，村庄；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"마을","audio":"/audio/16a6e53889b32d5b72f4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61099","senseId":"1","lemma":"마을","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"단수가","meaning":"停水，断水","explanation":"단수：停水，断水；가：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"단수","audio":"/audio/397df2f6e7e457f9aafe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"19908","senseId":"1","lemma":"단수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"된대.","meaning":"到","explanation":"되다：到；ㄴ대：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"3","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c91f5f33a1ff6924","term":"모레","zh":"后天","audio":"/audio/c91f5f33a1ff69245245.mp3","entryId":"16136","definition":"在明天的下一天。","pronunciation":["모ː레"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"16a6e53889b32d5b","term":"마을","zh":"村子，村庄","audio":"/audio/16a6e53889b32d5b72f4.mp3","entryId":"61099","definition":"多户人家聚集生活的地方。","pronunciation":["마을"]},{"id":"397df2f6e7e457f9","term":"단수","zh":"停水，断水","audio":"/audio/397df2f6e7e457f9aafe.mp3","entryId":"19908","definition":"中断自来水的供给。","pronunciation":["단ː수"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"到","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"到达某个时间、时期或状态。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4e489e812485cd58911a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n16136-1-5-2","ko":"그럼 오늘하고 내일 미리 물을 좀 받아 놓아야겠어.","zh":"那今天和明天得提前把水存一些起来。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오늘하고","meaning":"今天，今日；表示两个以上的并列或反复。","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日；하다：表示两个以上的并列或反复。；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"},{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"26","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내일","meaning":"明天，明日","explanation":"내일：明天，明日","readings":[{"term":"내일","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30193","senseId":"1","lemma":"내일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"미리","meaning":"事先，预先，事前，提前","explanation":"미리：事先，预先，事前，提前","readings":[{"term":"미리","audio":"/audio/b7c8ef4933c71a834692.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56292","senseId":"1","lemma":"미리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"물을","meaning":"水","explanation":"물：水；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"물","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17596","senseId":"1","lemma":"물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一点点，有一点","explanation":"좀：一点点，有一点","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"1","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"받아","meaning":"接，蓄","explanation":"받다：接，蓄；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"18","lemma":"받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"놓아야겠어.","meaning":"表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。","explanation":"놓다：表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"놓다","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72578","senseId":"1","lemma":"놓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示两个以上的并列或反复。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示两个以上的并列或反复。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"1e07b94ba5182a41","term":"내일","zh":"明天，明日","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3","entryId":"30193","definition":"今天的下一天。","pronunciation":["내일"]},{"id":"b7c8ef4933c71a83","term":"미리","zh":"事先，预先，事前，提前","audio":"/audio/b7c8ef4933c71a834692.mp3","entryId":"56292","definition":"先于某件事情发生之前。","pronunciation":["미리"]},{"id":"2e7edc957ce601f5","term":"물","zh":"水","audio":"/audio/2e7edc957ce601f5ff7c.mp3","entryId":"17596","definition":"含在河、湖、海、地下水等，纯粹的且无色无香无味的透明液体。","pronunciation":["물"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一点点，有一点","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"分量或程度稀少地。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"5af01487318c0c57","term":"받다","zh":"接，蓄","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3","entryId":"66636","definition":"把流淌或洒出来的东西用碗等盛起来。","pronunciation":["받따"]},{"id":"bac7d20277d64d67","term":"놓다","zh":"表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3","entryId":"72578","definition":"表示前面所指的行为结束后其结果仍持续。","pronunciation":["노타"]}],"audio":"/audio/8f11a38b226979856c90.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.896,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=16136","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":56,"sequenceScore":2.4936,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["那今天和明天得提前把水存一些起来。","听说后天我们村里要停水了。","刚才我给家里打电话，没人接啊。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["听说后天我们村里要停水了。","刚才我给家里打电话，没人接啊。","那今天和明天得提前把水存一些起来。"],"answer":2}]}
